WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.930
The Digital World,

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.090
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.520
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.270
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:22.030
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.690
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.980
Our team, Xros Heart,

00:01:54.980 --> 00:02:00.400
has defeated two of the seven 
powerful Death Generals,

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.970
and now we've moved on to the 
third Kingdom, Honey Land.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:15.160
This kingdom's Death General, Zamielmon,

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.690
is a fearsome enemy who sucks 
out the data of Digimon

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:19.880
and makes it into DigiHoney.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.460
But there is a Digimon here

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:29.730
named Mervamon who has stood up 
against Zamielmon by herself.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:39.550
<b>The Laughing Hunter!</b>

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:39.550
<b>General Zamielmon the Wood Spirit</b>

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:37.490
The Laughing Hunter! 
General Zamielmon the Wood Spirit!

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:47.560
I've made you all suffer until 
now, as Zamielmon's minion.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:49.920
I'm sorry.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:55.130
But from now on, 
I'll fight Zamielmon, too.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:56.720
You better believe it.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.020
You're going to make up for all 
the pain you caused everyone.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.360
I know, sister.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:08.300
All right, Ignitemon, let's work 
together and defeat Zamielmon.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.580
I'm so glad.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.590
It must be so hard to fight with 
your own sibling as enemies.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:18.640
Now, let's attack Zamielmon's 
castle and defeat him!

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.850
Too soon, sister...

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.600
Sheesh...

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.750
She never changes.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:48.540
You won't be getting any DigiHoney 
from us in a hundred years.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.610
What's going on? The fog just...

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.550
Spiral Flower!

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.880
Blaster Tail!

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.490
There's no end to them.

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:15.670
Greymon, cut a path through them!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.390
Reload, MailBirdramon!

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.800
Wow, that was great!

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.630
Who was that?

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:12.390
Now, let's send these 
invitations to them.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.120
We said we'd defeat him,

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.450
but it's hard to fight 
someone that small, Taiki.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.400
Yeah. It's really hard to battle him as is.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.320
<i>He's hard to fight because he's so small!</i>

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.910
If we could stop him from moving,

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:35.210
or if he were a little 
bigger, we could hit him...

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.240
Now that you mention it...

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.490
He's forcing himself to stay small.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.490
What?

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:53.780
Zamielmon's body gets smaller 
when he eats DigiHoney.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:57.350
Eating DigiHoney makes him smaller?

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.330
So that's why...

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.380
So let's make him bigger 
and then defeat him!

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.380
What's that?

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:17.900
"You are invited to a day of fun 
at my theme park, Honey Park.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.720
This is your passport.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:23.260
If you do not come,

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:26.590
other Digimon will be forcibly 
invited in your place.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.200
I will be waiting.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.590
The Honey Land Death 
General, Zamielmon."

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.670
An invitation from Zamielmon?

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.400
What's Honey Park?

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.130
It's Zamielmon's hunting ground.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:42.650
He puts weak Digimon in there 
and hunts them for fun.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.220
What should we do, Taiki?

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:45.720
This is perfect. Let's go.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.750
But it's a trap.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:49.390
We'll use that trap to get to him.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.090
What do you mean?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.980
We have an ally who's doing

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:54.680
his own thing right now, don't we?

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.510
Master Kiriha!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.140
I've been looking for you.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:05.740
I have a message from Master Taiki.

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.610
From Taiki?

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.550
Kiriha, Zamielmon has 
invited us to Honey Park,

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.460
and we're going there now.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.580
This is probably a trap.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:24.160
We'll evade his attacks 
and draw his attention.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:29.960
I want you to get the DigiHoney 
from his castle in the meantime.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.800
The DigiHoney?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:36.110
Yeah. Zamielmon keeps 
himself small by eating it.

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:38.710
So I think we should initiate 
a prolonged battle,

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:43.040
and attack when the DigiHoney's 
effect wears off and he gets bigger.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:47.810
I see. You want me to cut 
off his supply of DigiHoney.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.830
Yes. Ignitemon knows where 
the DigiHoney is stored.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:55.520
I'll send him your way 
with Beelzebumon now.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.370
I understand the plan.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.790
If you need more allies 
to fight, I'll send more.

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.890
I've got enough.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:03.460
But be careful.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.560
I just ran into someone I 
don't know in the forest.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.380
Was it one of Zamielmon's minions?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.390
I don't know.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:13.750
Anyway, I'll carry out your strategy 
now and then come to assist you.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.840
Do your best to hold 
your ground until then.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.880
Who did Kiriha run into?

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.780
If it wasn't a minion of Zamielmon's...

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.650
Whoever it was, let's knock them out!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:27.320
Yeah!

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:30.000
Okay! Reload, Beelzebumon!

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:36.220
Beelzebumon, you take 
Ignitemon and join Kiriha.

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.630
Very well.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:41.670
All right, let's go check 
out this Honey Park!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:57.510
They may look cute shaking 
their butts like that,

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.050
but those are the guys 
who sucked out our power.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:10.400
Welcome to Honey Park!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.100
Zamielmon!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:15.480
I'm going to play with you 
to my heart's content.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.450
Come on, get in!

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:26.400
If you defeat me in our game,

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:28.960
I'll return all the DigiHoney I stole.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:33.090
And you'd better be careful 
you don't get a game over.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.000
He's making me mad...

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:39.540
As if I would give anyone 
my precious DigiHoney.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:44.960
After I've had my fun tormenting you, 
I'll torture you to death.

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:05.250
C-Cold...

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:08.810
First is the ice attraction.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.850
If you can evade my 
attacks for three minutes,

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:13.190
you'll be able to enjoy 
the next attraction.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:16.380
Now, start running and try 
not to let me hunt you!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:20.600
Ouch...

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.560
He's so small, I can't tell where 
the arrows are coming from!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.690
Well, our only choice is to 
evade him for three minutes!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.440
Okay, guys, we need your help!

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:36.210
Pyramid Formation!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.180
It never ends!

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:43.130
Come on now, it'll only hurt more 
if these arrows keep hitting you!

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:45.040
You're supposed to dodge them!

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.500
Kiriha, we're counting on you!

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:13.940
Cutemon!

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.140
Rowdy Rocker!

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.670
It's too hard to aim at him!

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.820
I guess there's really no 
way but to make him bigger.

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.590
We have to hold out until then!

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:34.110
Your three minutes are up!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.520
Time for the next attraction!

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:51.760
They're all in there!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.720
Where is the DigiHoney stored?

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.320
In the castle depths!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.300
Okay, I'm going in from the back!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:08.440
The second attraction is Small Mountain.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:13.180
This time, I'll be hunting 
you for five minutes!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.360
I can't move anymore...

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.790
I should let Knightmon and 
the PawnChessmons rest a bit.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.970
Thanks, guys! 
Get back in the Xros Loader!

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:41.840
Hang in there just a 
little longer, guys!

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.270
Right!

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.640
How long do we have to 
play with him, anyway?!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.880
Hang in there, Sparrowmon!

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.430
<i>He's a little bigger now than he was.</i>

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.880
<i>If we keep it up just a bit longer,</i>

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.720
<i>he'll reach a size we 
can defeat more easily!</i>

00:12:59.090 --> 00:12:59.960
Greymon!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.000
MailBirdramon!

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.140
DigiXros!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.830
MetalGreymon!

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.180
Needle Stinger!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.240
What stubborn prey you are.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:26.280
But I'll bring you down next time!

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:31.890
Death the Cannon!

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:33.760
Trident Arm!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:43.730
Here?

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:44.970
Yes!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.220
Fly Spark!

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.490
These guys are real pests!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.600
This is my shooting range.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:03.880
Your what?!

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:06.230
What do you find so amusing about this?!

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:10.880
I'm having a great time 
here in Honey Park!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:13.770
This theme park is only here for 
you to have a good time, isn't it?!

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.160
Exactly!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.670
Now to enjoy my hunt!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:28.250
Taiki, at this rate, we're sitting ducks!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.220
Where is Kiriha? He's taking too long!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.350
We can't take much more!

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:33.470
Kiriha will come through.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.420
If we just wait a little 
longer, I know he will!

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:37.060
Yes.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.370
How can you trust him so?

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:40.990
He's our teammate!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.430
Taiki! I've got all the DigiHoney!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.730
Zamielmon can't make 
himself small anymore!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.370
Really? All right!

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.650
What? My DigiHoney?

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:56.810
Whoa! I didn't realize 
I had gotten this big!

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:58.780
Now you can't make yourself small again!

00:14:59.150 --> 00:14:59.860
You!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:03.770
You've been pretending to 
play with me to buy time?!

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:05.410
I won't forgive you!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:07.140
That's our line!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.580
What kind of theme 
park is this, anyway?!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.670
Now it's our turn!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:14.760
Now that he's an easy size to fight!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.480
What's this?

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:24.440
It looks like you don't know 
how formidable I truly am!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:42.060
This is how big I really am!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.860
But when I'm this big,

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:48.700
I can defeat any Digimon 
right away. It's no fun.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:53.260
So I used DigiHoney to become 
as small as I wished.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:57.480
Looks like it's going to be quite 
fun to crush you like bugs!

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.770
H-He's way too big.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:04.650
This is more than I expected.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:05.990
At any rate, we've got to attack!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.260
Shoutmon!

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:24.860
Okay!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:27.370
Ballistamon!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:29.970
Dorulumon!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.110
Starmons!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.200
Yes!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.550
DigiXros!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.850
DigiXros!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.350
Shoutmon X4!

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.570
Mervamon!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.510
Sparrowmon!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.710
DigiXros!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.420
DigiXros!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.410
JetMervamon!

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.540
I'm very quick for my size!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.920
X4!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.690
Has our strategy worked against us?

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:01.170
I never thought he'd be so huge, 
and so fast on top of that.

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:04.460
What's the problem, Taiki?  
Have faith in your own strategy!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:08.090
He's bigger now, 
just like you wanted, right?

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.420
Him getting bigger was part of the plan!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.440
Kiriha!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:14.610
At least now, our attacks will hit him!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:31.890
Insolent little...

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:33.690
You're right, Kiriha.

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.940
Our strategy isn't done yet!

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:37.500
The real battle begins now!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:41.120
You better believe it!

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:43.870
This is where we show our true strength!

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.340
Let's do it, Kiriha!

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:46.740
Yeah!

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:49.710
Shoutmon!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.240
Digivolve!

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:56.250
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:00.750
OmegaShoutmon!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.930
MetalGreymon!

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:05.660
Digivolve!

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:12.000
MetalGreymon, Digivolve!

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.130
ZekeGreymon!

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:20.940
OmegaShoutmon!

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:22.410
ZekeGreymon!

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.310
Double Xros!

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.010
OmegaShoutmon!

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:31.520
ZekeGreymon!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.220
Double Xros!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.250
Shoutmon DX!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:43.490
So you can merge together! So what?!

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.120
I've got it! Nene, help me!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.240
This is the end!

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.220
The World Shot!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.010
No matter how fast he is,

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:32.280
the instant after he dodges 
an attack, he stands still!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:35.550
Brave Beat Rock Double Xros!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:45.490
I never thought... 
they could land a hit on me!

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.640
All right! You defeated the 
Death General of Honey Land!

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:10.950
We've finally defeated Zamielmon.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.290
Even a Death General can be 
brought down if we work together!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.320
That's right.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:18.990
I've come to like you guys.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:23.290
I will travel with you.

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:25.200
Mervamon!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:29.030
Ignitemon, I'm entrusting Honey 
Land to you and Stingmon.

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:31.700
Got it, sister!

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.750
Good to have you on board, Mervamon.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:35.940
Sure! Just follow me, Nene!

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:37.300
Huh?

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:38.240
I'm opposed!

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:40.950
Kiriha?

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:42.650
Just who was that?

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.280
Who?

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:48.390
The one I saw when I was fighting 
in the Honey Land forest.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:50.120
A kid with blond hair.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:52.350
Blond hair?

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:13.200
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:13.200
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:17.150
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.160
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.160
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:35.130
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:26.860
<b>Ghost Type</b>

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:35.130
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Hell's Hand 
Death Charm</b>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>G</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.120
Bakemon.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:30.150
His special attack is Hell's Hand.

00:22:30.150 --> 00:22:32.960
It seems that what's under the 
sheet is a complete mystery.

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:35.130
Right, I'll just go run a 
search on what's inside!

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:37.100
You'll be cast into hell!

00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:39.570
Have a nice trip...

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:42.930
Well, Taiki,

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:45.540
let's have fun battling for 
control of the Digital World!

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:47.750
Yuu is being manipulated 
by DarkKnightmon?

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:51.120
Wait for me, Yuu! 
I swear I'll save you!

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:52.550
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Why, Brother, Why?!</b>

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The Enemy General Yuu's Nightmare</b>

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
